flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin optimization"]
InitOptimization["**Initialize Optimization**<br/>Set population size generations seed and cores"]
CreateProblem["**Create Problem**<br/>Instantiate BufferCapacityProblem with 6 variables capacities {1-10} objectives wip min throughput max"]
SamplingInit["**Sampling and Operators**<br/>Integer random sampling SBX crossover PM mutation setup"]
StartGALoop["**Start GA Loop**<br/>Initialize population and generation counter"]
EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**<br/>Call Problem._evaluate for current population"]
PoolEvaluate["**Parallel Evaluation Pool**<br/>multiprocessing Pool of worker processes"]
EvaluateIndividual["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>evaluate_single_individual runs multiple replications in sequence"]
MooRunSimulation["**Run Simulation Instance**<br/>moo_run_simulation invoked with a capacity vector"]
BuildSimpyModel["**Build Simpy Model**<br/>Instantiate DelayBuffer and Machine objects using capacity vector"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens store methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity methods run waiting_energy working_energy"]
RunSim["**Execute Simpy Run**<br/>Warmup reset stats sample WIP run until measure time"]
CollectMetrics["**Collect Metrics**<br/>Compute throughput WIP produced parts and machine energy per replication"]
AggregateReplications["**Aggregate Replications**<br/>Compute average WIP and average throughput across replications return objectives"]
ReturnObjectives["**Return Objectives**<br/>Format objective vector with WIP minimize and negative throughput for maximization"]
NSGA2Evolution["**NSGA2 Evolution**<br/>Selection crossover mutation and next population generation"]
CheckTermination["**Check Termination**<br/>Stop when generation limit reached"]
ExportHistoryCSV["**Export Results**<br/>Write history CSV with generation individual capacities WIP throughput"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization finished and results saved"]

Start --> InitOptimization
InitOptimization --> CreateProblem
CreateProblem --> SamplingInit
SamplingInit --> StartGALoop
StartGALoop --> EvaluatePopulation
EvaluatePopulation --> PoolEvaluate
PoolEvaluate --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> MooRunSimulation
MooRunSimulation --> BuildSimpyModel
BuildSimpyModel --> DelayBufferClass
BuildSimpyModel --> MachineClass
BuildSimpyModel --> RunSim
RunSim --> CollectMetrics
CollectMetrics --> AggregateReplications
AggregateReplications --> ReturnObjectives
ReturnObjectives --> EvaluatePopulation
ReturnObjectives --> NSGA2Evolution
NSGA2Evolution --> CheckTermination
CheckTermination --> StartGALoop
CheckTermination --> ExportHistoryCSV
ExportHistoryCSV --> End